            "heading": "3. Arithmetic Rules with Significant Figures",
            "headingHinglish": "3. Arithmetic Rules with Significant Figures",
            "body": "Dhyan rakho — addition/subtraction aur multiplication/division ke rules **ALAG** hain!\n\n- **Addition & Subtraction:** Final result mein utne hi **decimal places** rakho jitne sabse kam decimal places wali input number mein hain.\n- **Multiplication & Division:** Final result mein utne hi **significant figures** rakho jitne sabse kam sig figs wali input number mein hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Dhyan rakho — addition/subtraction aur multiplication/division ke rules **ALAG** hain!\n\n- **Addition & Subtraction:** Final result mein utne hi **decimal places** rakho jitne sabse kam decimal places wali input number mein hain.\n- **Multiplication & Division:** Final result mein utne hi **significant figures** rakho jitne sabse kam sig figs wali input number mein hain."
