            "bodyHinglish": "Upendra ek experimental astrophysics research fellow hai. Ek high-energy telescope project mein uski team ne mass, length, time ki jagah **Force (F), Velocity (V), aur Time (T)** ko fundamental units maan kar apna simulation banaya. Saath hi unke custom optical micrometer mein **20 VSD = 18 MSD** tha (standard 19 MSD nahi!), aur sensor circuit mein do resistors **parallel** mein lage the jinka error simple product rule se nahi nikalta.\n\nChalo Upendra ke saath in chaar high-level techniques ko ekdam crystal clear karte hain!"
