            "heading": "Damodar ka Runway Takeoff & Braking Check",
            "headingHinglish": "Damodar ka Runway Takeoff & Braking Check",
            "body": "Damodar ek airport par runway safety officer hai. Ek jet plane rest (u = 0) se start hokar constant acceleration se **12 s** mein **72 m/s** takeoff speed pakad leta hai. Damodar ko check karna hai ki kya **500 m** ka runway kaafi hai ya nahi!\n\nSaath hi, highway safety check mein use pata hai ki agar koi car **20 m/s** ki speed se **-4 m/s²** deceleration par brake lagaye, toh woh **50 m** mein rukti hai — par agar speed double (**40 m/s**) ho jaye, toh braking distance double nahi balki **4 guna (200 m)** ho jata hai!\n\nAisa kyun hota hai? Chalo uniform acceleration ke equations derive karke samajhte hain!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Damodar ek airport par runway safety officer hai. Ek jet plane rest (u = 0) se start hokar constant acceleration se **12 s** mein **72 m/s** takeoff speed pakad leta hai. Damodar ko check karna hai ki kya **500 m** ka runway kaafi hai ya nahi!\n\nSaath hi, highway safety check mein use pata hai ki agar koi car **20 m/s** ki speed se **-4 m/s²** deceleration par brake lagaye, toh woh **50 m** mein rukti hai — par agar speed double (**40 m/s**) ho jaye, toh braking distance double nahi balki **4 guna (200 m)** ho jata hai!\n\nAisa kyun hota hai? Chalo uniform acceleration ke equations derive karke samajhte hain!"
