            "bodyHinglish": "Babulal ek harbour pilot hai. Ek bhari cargo barge ko do tugboats aage kheench rahi hain — ek **6 N** (scaled model force) se East mein aur doosri **8 N** se North mein (90° angle par).\n\nBabulal ke assistant ne kaha, \"Sir, total pull 6 + 8 = 14 N hua na?\" Babulal muskura kar bole, \"Nahi beta! Dono alag directions mein kheench rahi hain — net force **10 N** hai, 14 N nahi! Direction ke saath jodne ka apna alag algebra hota hai — **Vector Algebra**!\""
