            "body": "Rajendra ek velodrome cycling aur lab-centrifuge engineer hai. Ek test rig mein usne ek chhote sensor ko **0.8 m** lambi rassi se baandh kar horizontal circle mein ghumaya — sensor ne **22 seconds** mein exact **14 revolutions** poore kiye!\n\nRajendra ke junior ne poocha, \"Sir, sensor ki speed toh constant **3.2 m/s** hai, toh iska acceleration 0 hua na?\" Rajendra ne screen par **12.8 m/s²** dikha kar kaha, \"Speed constant hai, **velocity nahi**! Har millisecond rassi use centre ki taraf mod rahi hai — aur yahi hai **Centripetal Acceleration**!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Rajendra ek velodrome cycling aur lab-centrifuge engineer hai. Ek test rig mein usne ek chhote sensor ko **0.8 m** lambi rassi se baandh kar horizontal circle mein ghumaya — sensor ne **22 seconds** mein exact **14 revolutions** poore kiye!\n\nRajendra ke junior ne poocha, \"Sir, sensor ki speed toh constant **3.2 m/s** hai, toh iska acceleration 0 hua na?\" Rajendra ne screen par **12.8 m/s²** dikha kar kaha, \"Speed constant hai, **velocity nahi**! Har millisecond rassi use centre ki taraf mod rahi hai — aur yahi hai **Centripetal Acceleration**!\""
