            "heading": "Harendra ka Search-and-Rescue Drone Operations Desk",
            "headingHinglish": "Harendra ka Search-and-Rescue Drone Operations Desk",
            "body": "Harendra ek Search-and-Rescue Drone Operations Lead hai. Ek hi mission mein use chaar alag 2D problems solve karni padti hain:\n1. Crosswind mein drone ka resultant vector nikalna,\n2. Flooded river paar karne ke liye rescue boat ka shortest-path angle set karna,\n3. Udte hue aircraft se relief packet girane ka exact release distance nikalna,\n4. Aur base ke upar drone ke circular loitering path ka centripetal acceleration check karna!\n\nIsliye Harendra ke paas ek **Decision Map** hai — dekhte hi sahi 2D formula click ho jata hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Harendra ek Search-and-Rescue Drone Operations Lead hai. Ek hi mission mein use chaar alag 2D problems solve karni padti hain:\n1. Crosswind mein drone ka resultant vector nikalna,\n2. Flooded river paar karne ke liye rescue boat ka shortest-path angle set karna,\n3. Udte hue aircraft se relief packet girane ka exact release distance nikalna,\n4. Aur base ke upar drone ke circular loitering path ka centripetal acceleration check karna!\n\nIsliye Harendra ke paas ek **Decision Map** hai — dekhte hi sahi 2D formula click ho jata hai."
