            "headingHinglish": "Hemendra ka Ice-Rink & Air-Track Demo",
            "body": "Hemendra ek physics demonstration lab mein air-track chalata hai. 2000 saal pehle Aristotle ne kaha tha: \"Kisi cheez ko chalte rakhne ke liye lagatar force lagana padta hai.\" Kyunki zameen par koi bhi ball thodi der baad ruk jati hai!\n\nPar jab Hemendra ne air-track on kiya (friction lagbhag zero!) aur ek glider ko halka sa dhakka diya, toh glider bina kisi force ke constant velocity se phisalta chala gaya! Galileo aur Newton ne samjhaya: **motion banaye rakhne ke liye nahi, balki friction ko cancel karne ke liye force lagta tha!**",
            "bodyHinglish": "Hemendra ek physics demonstration lab mein air-track chalata hai. 2000 saal pehle Aristotle ne kaha tha: \"Kisi cheez ko chalte rakhne ke liye lagatar force lagana padta hai.\" Kyunki zameen par koi bhi ball thodi der baad ruk jati hai!\n\nPar jab Hemendra ne air-track on kiya (friction lagbhag zero!) aur ek glider ko halka sa dhakka diya, toh glider bina kisi force ke constant velocity se phisalta chala gaya! Galileo aur Newton ne samjhaya: **motion banaye rakhne ke liye nahi, balki friction ko cancel karne ke liye force lagta tha!**"
