            "bodyHinglish": "Zubeida ek robotics-dynamics researcher hai. Uske lab mein ek chhota block ek **smooth 37° wedge** par rakha hai — wedge ko horizontally kis exact acceleration a = g tan 37° = 7.5 m/s² se chalaya jaye ki block wedge par bina phisle chipka rahe? Aur jab ek **2 kg** block ek **4 kg** block ke upar rakha ho (μ = 0.5), toh neeche wale block ko kitne max force se kheenchne tak dono saath chalenge?\n\nChalo Zubeida ke saath in paanch elite dynamics weapons ko ekdam crystal clear karte hain!"
