            "headingHinglish": "1. Derivation of Instantaneous Power (P = F · v)",
            "body": "Chhote time interval dt mein agar force **F** chhota displacement **dr** kare, toh work dW = F · dr.\nDono taraf dt se divide karne par:\n```\n  P = dW / dt = F · (dr / dt) = F · v = F v cos θ\n```\n*(Note: Power ek **scalar** quantity hai — dot product of Force and Velocity!)*",
            "bodyHinglish": "Chhote time interval dt mein agar force **F** chhota displacement **dr** kare, toh work dW = F · dr.\nDono taraf dt se divide karne par:\n```\n  P = dW / dt = F · (dr / dt) = F · v = F v cos θ\n```\n*(Note: Power ek **scalar** quantity hai — dot product of Force and Velocity!)*"
