            "headingHinglish": "2. Two Classic Power Applications",
            "body": "1. **Water Pump Lifting Mass m to Height h (and ejecting at speed v):**\n   - Sirf lift karne ki power: **P = (m / t) g h**\n   - Lift + kinetic energy of jet: **P = (m / t) (g h + (1/2) v²)**\n   - Agar efficiency η ho: **P_input = P_useful / η**\n\n2. **Vehicle / Elevator at Constant Speed v:**\n   - Constant speed => F_motor = Gravity component + Friction/Drag.\n   - **P = F_motor × v**",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Water Pump Lifting Mass m to Height h (and ejecting at speed v):**\n   - Sirf lift karne ki power: **P = (m / t) g h**\n   - Lift + kinetic energy of jet: **P = (m / t) (g h + (1/2) v²)**\n   - Agar efficiency η ho: **P_input = P_useful / η**\n\n2. **Vehicle / Elevator at Constant Speed v:**\n   - Constant speed => F_motor = Gravity component + Friction/Drag.\n   - **P = F_motor × v**"
