            "bodyHinglish": "Narottam ek billiards-physics aur nuclear-reactor safety analyst hai. Usne dekha:\n- Jab ek billiard ball doosri **equal-mass** ruki hui ball se seedhi (head-on elastic) takrati hai, toh pehli ball wahin **ruk jati hai** aur doosri exact usi speed se aage nikal jati hai — **velocities swap ho jati hain!**\n- Par jab do mitti ke gole takra kar chipak jate hain (**completely inelastic**), toh momentum conserve rehta hai, par **kinetic energy ka bada hissa heat aur sound mein udd jata hai!**"
