            "bodyHinglish": "Koi bhi collision ho (elastic, inelastic, ya completely inelastic), agar external impulsive force zero ho:\n- **Linear Momentum is ALWAYS conserved:** m₁ u₁ + m₂ u₂ = m₁ v₁ + m₂ v₂.\n- **Kinetic Energy is conserved ONLY in Elastic Collisions (e = 1)!**"
