            "heading": "Ompal ka Renewable-Energy & Test-Track Command Station",
            "headingHinglish": "Ompal ka Renewable-Energy & Test-Track Command Station",
            "body": "Ompal ek Renewable-Energy & Test-Track Coordinator hai. Uske test yard mein ek hi problem ke andar do-teen concepts judte hain — jaise ek bullet ka block mein dhansna aur phir us block ka spring ko dabana, ya ek rough ramp se phisalkar bumper spring par rukna! Ompal ka **Decision Map** har sawaal ka rasta turant dikha deta hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ompal ek Renewable-Energy & Test-Track Coordinator hai. Uske test yard mein ek hi problem ke andar do-teen concepts judte hain — jaise ek bullet ka block mein dhansna aur phir us block ka spring ko dabana, ya ek rough ramp se phisalkar bumper spring par rukna! Ompal ka **Decision Map** har sawaal ka rasta turant dikha deta hai."
