            "body": "Girdhari ek physics lab mein ek smooth-looking (slightly rough) 30° ramp par same mass aur same radius ke teen objects ek saath rest se chhodta hai:\n1. **Solid Sphere** (K²/R² = 2/5 = 0.40)\n2. **Solid Disc** (K²/R² = 1/2 = 0.50)\n3. **Hollow Ring** (K²/R² = 1 = 1.00)\n\nKaun sabse pehle neeche pahunchega? **Solid Sphere HAMESHA jeet-ta hai, phir Disc, aur Ring sabse aakhir mein!** Mass aur radius chahe kuch bhi hon, result kabhi nahi badalta! Kyun? Chalo **Pure Rolling** ka physics dekhte hain!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Girdhari ek physics lab mein ek smooth-looking (slightly rough) 30° ramp par same mass aur same radius ke teen objects ek saath rest se chhodta hai:\n1. **Solid Sphere** (K²/R² = 2/5 = 0.40)\n2. **Solid Disc** (K²/R² = 1/2 = 0.50)\n3. **Hollow Ring** (K²/R² = 1 = 1.00)\n\nKaun sabse pehle neeche pahunchega? **Solid Sphere HAMESHA jeet-ta hai, phir Disc, aur Ring sabse aakhir mein!** Mass aur radius chahe kuch bhi hon, result kabhi nahi badalta! Kyun? Chalo **Pure Rolling** ka physics dekhte hain!"
