            "body": "Jawahar ek Robotics & Precision-Gyroscope Director hai. Uske test bench par har problem mein linear aur rotational mechanics haath mila kar kaam karte hain — kabhi heavy pulley + hanging block, kabhi spinning disc par naya mass drop hona, toh kabhi rod-hinge ka swing! Jawahar ka **Decision Map** har rotational problem ka fastest approach dikha deta hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Jawahar ek Robotics & Precision-Gyroscope Director hai. Uske test bench par har problem mein linear aur rotational mechanics haath mila kar kaam karte hain — kabhi heavy pulley + hanging block, kabhi spinning disc par naya mass drop hona, toh kabhi rod-hinge ka swing! Jawahar ka **Decision Map** har rotational problem ka fastest approach dikha deta hai."
