            "headingHinglish": "2. Minimum Friction Coefficient for Pure Rolling on an Incline",
            "body": "Incline (angle θ) par pure rolling mein static friction lagta hai:\nf = M g sin θ - M a = M g sin θ [ 1 - 1 / (1 + K²/R²) ] = **M g sin θ / (1 + R² / K²)**\n\nSlipping rokne ke liye f ≤ μ_s N = μ_s M g cos θ:\n```\n  μ_min = tan θ / ( 1 + R² / K² )\n```\n- **Solid Sphere** (R²/K² = 5/2): **μ_min = (2/7) tan θ**\n- **Solid Disc / Cylinder** (R²/K² = 2): **μ_min = (1/3) tan θ**\n- **Ring** (R²/K² = 1): **μ_min = (1/2) tan θ**",
            "bodyHinglish": "Incline (angle θ) par pure rolling mein static friction lagta hai:\nf = M g sin θ - M a = M g sin θ [ 1 - 1 / (1 + K²/R²) ] = **M g sin θ / (1 + R² / K²)**\n\nSlipping rokne ke liye f ≤ μ_s N = μ_s M g cos θ:\n```\n  μ_min = tan θ / ( 1 + R² / K² )\n```\n- **Solid Sphere** (R²/K² = 5/2): **μ_min = (2/7) tan θ**\n- **Solid Disc / Cylinder** (R²/K² = 2): **μ_min = (1/3) tan θ**\n- **Ring** (R²/K² = 1): **μ_min = (1/2) tan θ**"
