            "heading": "3. Toppling vs Slipping of a Cube (Side a)",
            "headingHinglish": "3. Toppling vs Slipping of a Cube (Side a)",
            "body": "Side **a**, mass **M** ka uniform cube rough floor (μ) par rakha hai. Upar se height **h** par horizontal force **F** lagaya jata hai:\n- **Slipping threshold:** F_slip = **μ M g**\n- **Toppling threshold** (moments about front-bottom edge; Normal shifts to front corner!):\n  F_topple × h = M g (a / 2)  =>  **F_topple = M g a / (2 h)**\n- **Kaun pehle hoga?** Jiska threshold **CHHOTA** ho!\n  - Agar **F_topple < F_slip** (i.e. **μ > a / (2 h)**) => **Topples FIRST!**\n  - Agar **F_slip < F_topple** (i.e. **μ < a / (2 h)**) => **Slips FIRST!**",
            "bodyHinglish": "Side **a**, mass **M** ka uniform cube rough floor (μ) par rakha hai. Upar se height **h** par horizontal force **F** lagaya jata hai:\n- **Slipping threshold:** F_slip = **μ M g**\n- **Toppling threshold** (moments about front-bottom edge; Normal shifts to front corner!):\n  F_topple × h = M g (a / 2)  =>  **F_topple = M g a / (2 h)**\n- **Kaun pehle hoga?** Jiska threshold **CHHOTA** ho!\n  - Agar **F_topple < F_slip** (i.e. **μ > a / (2 h)**) => **Topples FIRST!**\n  - Agar **F_slip < F_topple** (i.e. **μ < a / (2 h)**) => **Slips FIRST!**"
