            "bodyHinglish": "Agar 3 masses m₁, m₂, m₃ distances r₁₂, r₂₃, r₃₁ par rakhe hon, toh **har unique pair** ko ek baar count karo (for N masses, N(N-1)/2 pairs!):\n```\n  U_total = - G ( m₁ m₂ / r₁₂ + m₂ m₃ / r₂₃ + m₃ m₁ / r₃₁ )\n```"
