            "body": "Gokuldas ek Space-Mission Operations Coordinator hai. Ek lunar-mission plan mein ek saath chaar cheezein judti hain: launch site par g check karna, Earth se height h tak pahunchane ki speed nikalna, parking orbit ki energy calculate karna, aur Kepler's Third Law se orbital period verify karna! Gokuldas ka **Decision Map** har gravitation sawaal ka exact formula turant saamne la deta hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Gokuldas ek Space-Mission Operations Coordinator hai. Ek lunar-mission plan mein ek saath chaar cheezein judti hain: launch site par g check karna, Earth se height h tak pahunchane ki speed nikalna, parking orbit ki energy calculate karna, aur Kepler's Third Law se orbital period verify karna! Gokuldas ka **Decision Map** har gravitation sawaal ka exact formula turant saamne la deta hai."
