            "body": "Pitam ek materials-testing lab mein tensile-testing machine chalata hai. Usne teen alag materials ko khinch kar unke Stress–Strain graphs compare kiye:\n1. **Mild Steel (Ductile):** Lamba plastic region — tootne se pehle khinch kar taar ban jata hai!\n2. **Glass / Cast Iron (Brittle):** Elastic limit ke turant baad bina warning ke chatak kar toot jata hai!\n3. **Rubber / Human Aorta (Elastomer):** Bahut bada elastic stretch (500% tak!), par curve straight line nahi hota — Hooke's Law follow nahi karta!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pitam ek materials-testing lab mein tensile-testing machine chalata hai. Usne teen alag materials ko khinch kar unke Stress–Strain graphs compare kiye:\n1. **Mild Steel (Ductile):** Lamba plastic region — tootne se pehle khinch kar taar ban jata hai!\n2. **Glass / Cast Iron (Brittle):** Elastic limit ke turant baad bina warning ke chatak kar toot jata hai!\n3. **Rubber / Human Aorta (Elastomer):** Bahut bada elastic stretch (500% tak!), par curve straight line nahi hota — Hooke's Law follow nahi karta!"
