            "heading": "1. Elongation of a Heavy Uniform Wire Under Its Own Weight",
            "headingHinglish": "1. Elongation of a Heavy Uniform Wire Under Its Own Weight",
            "body": "Length **L**, mass **M**, density **ρ**, area **A** ki wire latki hai. Bottom se height y par tension T(y) = (M g / L) y — yani tension linearly 0 (bottom) se M g (top) tak badhta hai => **average tension = M g / 2**!\n```\n  ΔL_self = (M g / 2) L / (A Y) = M g L / (2 A Y) = ρ g L² / (2 Y)\n```\n*(Notice: Half the elongation produced if the same mass M hung at the bottom of a massless wire!)*",
            "bodyHinglish": "Length **L**, mass **M**, density **ρ**, area **A** ki wire latki hai. Bottom se height y par tension T(y) = (M g / L) y — yani tension linearly 0 (bottom) se M g (top) tak badhta hai => **average tension = M g / 2**!\n```\n  ΔL_self = (M g / 2) L / (A Y) = M g L / (2 A Y) = ρ g L² / (2 Y)\n```\n*(Notice: Half the elongation produced if the same mass M hung at the bottom of a massless wire!)*"
