            "bodyHinglish": "Temperature ΔT badhne par free rod **ΔL = L α ΔT** failti (thermal strain = α ΔT). Agar dono ends rigid walls ke beech clamp kar diye jayein, toh deewarein utna hi compressive strain paida karti hain:\n```\n  Thermal Stress:   σ_thermal = Y α ΔT      |      Force on walls:   F = Y A α ΔT\n```\n*(Notice: Thermal stress length L par bilkul depend NAHI karta!)*"
