            "bodyHinglish": "Mass **M** (density **ρ**), radius **R**, area **A** ki thin ring angular velocity **ω** se ghoom rahi hai. Chhote arc element (dθ) par radial force balance: 2 T sin(dθ/2) = (dm) ω² R => **T = ρ A ω² R²**!\n- Tensile stress: **σ = T / A = ρ ω² R²**\n- Strain: Δ(2πR) / (2πR) = ΔR / R = σ / Y = **ρ ω² R² / Y**\n- Increase in radius: **ΔR = ρ ω² R³ / Y**!"
