            "bodyHinglish": "Jugal ek auto-service workshop mein hydraulic lift chalata hai. Ek chhote piston (area **10 cm²**) par sirf **200 N** ka force lagane se doosre bade piston (area **1000 cm²**) par **20,000 N (2 tonne car!)** aasani se upar uth jati hai!\n\nYeh koi energy ka jaadu nahi (chhota piston 100 cm neeche jata hai tab car 1 cm upar uthti hai — work conserved hai!) — balki **Pascal's Law** ka kamaal hai: band (confined) liquid mein lagaya gaya pressure har disha mein **bina ghate** fail jata hai!"
