            "heading": "Baldev ka Railway-Track & Metal-Washer Puzzle",
            "headingHinglish": "Baldev ka Railway-Track & Metal-Washer Puzzle",
            "body": "Baldev ek railway-track aur bimetallic-thermostat technician hai. Usne ek metal washer (beech mein gol chhed wali flat steel disc) ko bhatti mein garam kiya aur trainee se poocha: \"Garam karne par beech ka **chhed (hole) bada hoga ya chhota**?\"\n\nTrainee ne kaha, \"Metal andar ki taraf failega toh chhed chhota ho jayega!\" Baldev muskura kar bole, \"Bilkul galat! Thermal expansion ek **photographic zoom-in** ki tarah hota hai — har linear dimension (outer radius, inner hole radius, thickness) exact same fraction α ΔT se **BADHTI** hai! Isliye garam karne par chhed **BADA** hota hai!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Baldev ek railway-track aur bimetallic-thermostat technician hai. Usne ek metal washer (beech mein gol chhed wali flat steel disc) ko bhatti mein garam kiya aur trainee se poocha: \"Garam karne par beech ka **chhed (hole) bada hoga ya chhota**?\"\n\nTrainee ne kaha, \"Metal andar ki taraf failega toh chhed chhota ho jayega!\" Baldev muskura kar bole, \"Bilkul galat! Thermal expansion ek **photographic zoom-in** ki tarah hota hai — har linear dimension (outer radius, inner hole radius, thickness) exact same fraction α ΔT se **BADHTI** hai! Isliye garam karne par chhed **BADA** hota hai!\""
