            "body": "Jagmohan ek food-processing aur ice-plant engineer hai. Usne workers ko ek zaroori safety baat samjhayi: \"100 °C ki **steam** se jalna, 100 °C ke **ubalte paani** se jalne se kahin zyada khatarnak hota hai! Kyun? Kyunki har 1 gram steam mein ubalte paani se **540 calories (2260 J) EXTRA Latent Heat of Vaporisation** chhupi hoti hai jo skin par condense hote hi release ho jati hai!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Jagmohan ek food-processing aur ice-plant engineer hai. Usne workers ko ek zaroori safety baat samjhayi: \"100 °C ki **steam** se jalna, 100 °C ke **ubalte paani** se jalne se kahin zyada khatarnak hota hai! Kyun? Kyunki har 1 gram steam mein ubalte paani se **540 calories (2260 J) EXTRA Latent Heat of Vaporisation** chhupi hoti hai jo skin par condense hote hi release ho jati hai!\""
