            "bodyHinglish": "Uddhav ek Thermal-Engineering Lab Director hai. Uske lab mein ek hi device mein expansion, calorimetry, conduction, aur radiation sab ek saath kaam karte hain! Uddhav ka **Decision Map** har thermal problem ka turant sahi formula chunta hai."
