            "headingHinglish": "2. Freezing Time of an Ice Layer on a Pond (t ∝ x²)",
            "body": "Hawa ka temperature **-θ °C** (so ΔT = θ across ice) hai aur neeche paani **0 °C** par hai. Jab ice ki thickness **x** ho, toh patli layer **dx** jamne mein latent heat **dQ = (ρ A dx) L** bahar nikalti hai through thickness **x**:\ndQ / dt = k A θ / x  =>  ρ A L (dx / dt) = k A θ / x  =>  x dx = (k θ / (ρ L)) dt!\n\nIntegrate from x = 0 to x (since integral of x dx is x²/2):\n```\n  t(0 -> x) = ρ L x² / (2 k θ)       |       t(x₁ -> x₂) = ρ L (x₂² - x₁²) / (2 k θ)\n```\n**Golden Result:** Time **t ∝ x²**! Equal thickness layers (0->1, 1->2, 2->3 cm) jamne ke times ka ratio **1 : 3 : 5** hota hai!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Hawa ka temperature **-θ °C** (so ΔT = θ across ice) hai aur neeche paani **0 °C** par hai. Jab ice ki thickness **x** ho, toh patli layer **dx** jamne mein latent heat **dQ = (ρ A dx) L** bahar nikalti hai through thickness **x**:\ndQ / dt = k A θ / x  =>  ρ A L (dx / dt) = k A θ / x  =>  x dx = (k θ / (ρ L)) dt!\n\nIntegrate from x = 0 to x (since integral of x dx is x²/2):\n```\n  t(0 -> x) = ρ L x² / (2 k θ)       |       t(x₁ -> x₂) = ρ L (x₂² - x₁²) / (2 k θ)\n```\n**Golden Result:** Time **t ∝ x²**! Equal thickness layers (0->1, 1->2, 2->3 cm) jamne ke times ka ratio **1 : 3 : 5** hota hai!"
