            "bodyHinglish": "Rukmini ek thermodynamics researcher hai. Uske lab mein har process hamesha pure isothermal ya adiabatic nahi hota — aksar gases ek general **Polytropic Process (P V^x = constant)** follow karti hain! Rukmini ka ek hi master formula **C = C_v + R / (1 - x)** poore thermodynamics ke sabhi processes (isobaric x=0, isothermal x=1, adiabatic x=γ, isochoric x=∞) ko ek line mein samet leta hai!"
