            "body": "Volume V aur temperature T mein agar n₁, n₂, n₃ moles of non-reacting gases hon:\n```\n  P_total = (n₁ + n₂ + n₃) R T / V  =  P₁ + P₂ + P₃\n```",
            "bodyHinglish": "Volume V aur temperature T mein agar n₁, n₂, n₃ moles of non-reacting gases hon:\n```\n  P_total = (n₁ + n₂ + n₃) R T / V  =  P₁ + P₂ + P₃\n```"
