            "bodyHinglish": "Narmada ek Atmospheric-Physics Lab Director hai. Uske lab mein har din upper-atmosphere gases ke v_rms, escape velocity comparisons, Dalton's partial pressures, equipartition γ values, aur mean free paths ek saath analyze kiye jate hain! Narmada ka **Decision Map** har kinetic-theory problem ka turant sahi formula chunta hai."
