            "bodyHinglish": "Tilottama ek statistical-mechanics researcher hai. Usne bataya ki ek gas mein sabhi molecules same speed se nahi chalte — unki speeds ek bell-like **Maxwell–Boltzmann curve** par faili hoti hain, jisme teen khaas speeds hoti hain:\n1. **Most Probable Speed (v_mp = √(2RT/M)):** Curve ka sabse ooncha peak!\n2. **Average (Mean) Speed (v_avg = √(8RT/(πM))):** Sabhi speeds ka seedha average!\n3. **RMS Speed (v_rms = √(3RT/M)):** Pressure aur KE ke liye!\n\nHamesha: **v_mp < v_avg < v_rms** (ratio **1 : 1.128 : 1.224**)!"
