            "bodyHinglish": "Tiny pinhole se gas ke bahar nikalne ka rate (effusion rate r) average molecular speed v_avg ke proportional hota hai:\n```\n  r ∝ P / √(M T)     (At same P and T:   r₁ / r₂ = √(M₂ / M₁) = √(ρ₂ / ρ₁) !)\n```"
