            "heading": "3. Equilibrium Temperature When Mixing Two Gases in an Insulated Container",
            "headingHinglish": "3. Equilibrium Temperature When Mixing Two Gases in an Insulated Container",
            "body": "Container 1 (n₁ moles, f₁ DOF, T₁) aur Container 2 (n₂ moles, f₂ DOF, T₂) ko insulated chamber mein valve khol kar milane par (ΔQ = 0, ΔW = 0 => **U_initial = U_final**):\nn₁ (f₁/2) R T₁ + n₂ (f₂/2) R T₂ = (n₁ f₁/2 + n₂ f₂/2) R T_f  =>\n```\n  T_f = ( n₁ f₁ T₁ + n₂ f₂ T₂ ) / ( n₁ f₁ + n₂ f₂ )\n```\n*(Same type of gas ho toh f₁ = f₂ cancel => **T_f = (n₁ T₁ + n₂ T₂) / (n₁ + n₂)**!)*",
            "bodyHinglish": "Container 1 (n₁ moles, f₁ DOF, T₁) aur Container 2 (n₂ moles, f₂ DOF, T₂) ko insulated chamber mein valve khol kar milane par (ΔQ = 0, ΔW = 0 => **U_initial = U_final**):\nn₁ (f₁/2) R T₁ + n₂ (f₂/2) R T₂ = (n₁ f₁/2 + n₂ f₂/2) R T_f  =>\n```\n  T_f = ( n₁ f₁ T₁ + n₂ f₂ T₂ ) / ( n₁ f₁ + n₂ f₂ )\n```\n*(Same type of gas ho toh f₁ = f₂ cancel => **T_f = (n₁ T₁ + n₂ T₂) / (n₁ + n₂)**!)*"
