            "bodyHinglish": "Bhuvaneshwari ek mechanical-watch aur car-suspension engineer hai. Usne do aise facts dikhaye jo aksar logon ko chaunka dete hain:\n1. Agar ek spring-mass oscillator ko Earth se **Moon** (jahan gravity 1/6th hai) ya **Space Station** (g = 0) par le jao, toh uska time period T = 2π √(m/k) **BILKUL NAHI BADALTA** — kyunki gravity sirf spring ki equilibrium position shift karti hai, time period nahi!\n2. Par agar ek **Simple Pendulum** ko Moon par le jao, toh uska time period T = 2π √(L/g) **√6 guna badh jata hai** (ghadi bahut slow ho jati hai!), aur space station (g = 0) mein pendulum bilkul oscillate hi nahi karta (T = ∞)!"
