            "headingHinglish": "1. Two-Body Spring Oscillator (Reduced Mass μ!)",
            "body": "Do free masses m₁ aur m₂ smooth floor par spring k se jude hain. Dono apne CM ke about opposite phase mein oscillate karte hain:\n```\n  T = 2 π √( μ / k )      where Reduced Mass:   μ = m₁ m₂ / (m₁ + m₂)\n```\n*(Check: Agar m₂ -> ∞ (rigid wall!), toh μ -> m₁ aur purana formula 2π √(m₁/k) wapas mil jata hai!)*",
            "bodyHinglish": "Do free masses m₁ aur m₂ smooth floor par spring k se jude hain. Dono apne CM ke about opposite phase mein oscillate karte hain:\n```\n  T = 2 π √( μ / k )      where Reduced Mass:   μ = m₁ m₂ / (m₁ + m₂)\n```\n*(Check: Agar m₂ -> ∞ (rigid wall!), toh μ -> m₁ aur purana formula 2π √(m₁/k) wapas mil jata hai!)*"
