            "headingHinglish": "Story Time: Draupadi aur Concert Hall ke Silent Spots",
            "body": "**Draupadi** ek concert-hall acoustics designer hai. Ek bade auditorium mein do identical speakers ek hi pure musical note baja rahe the. Jab wo hall mein aage-peeche chali, toh usne kuch ajeeb notice kiya: kuch spots par aawaz **double loud** thi, aur thoda sa aage badhne par aawaz lagbhag **bilkul gaayab (silent spot)** ho gayi!\n\nPhir usne ek lambi rassi ko deewar se bandh kar jhatka diya — crest deewar se takra kar **ulta (trough ban kar)** wapas aaya, aur aate-jaate waves ke overlap hone se rassi par aise loops ban gaye jo aage badhte hi nahi the!\n\nDraupadi ne apni team se kaha: *\"Yahi hai **Superposition** aur **Standing Waves** ka jaadu — jab do waves milti hain, toh wo ek-doosre ko jod bhi sakti hain aur mita bhi sakti hain!\"*",
            "bodyHinglish": "**Draupadi** ek concert-hall acoustics designer hai. Ek bade auditorium mein do identical speakers ek hi pure musical note baja rahe the. Jab wo hall mein aage-peeche chali, toh usne kuch ajeeb notice kiya: kuch spots par aawaz **double loud** thi, aur thoda sa aage badhne par aawaz lagbhag **bilkul gaayab (silent spot)** ho gayi!\n\nPhir usne ek lambi rassi ko deewar se bandh kar jhatka diya — crest deewar se takra kar **ulta (trough ban kar)** wapas aaya, aur aate-jaate waves ke overlap hone se rassi par aise loops ban gaye jo aage badhte hi nahi the!\n\nDraupadi ne apni team se kaha: *\"Yahi hai **Superposition** aur **Standing Waves** ka jaadu — jab do waves milti hain, toh wo ek-doosre ko jod bhi sakti hain aur mita bhi sakti hain!\"*"
