            "heading": "Story Time: Sulekha aur Heavy Hanging Cable ka Puzzle",
            "headingHinglish": "Story Time: Sulekha aur Heavy Hanging Cable ka Puzzle",
            "body": "**Sulekha** ek theoretical-acoustics aur wave-propagation researcher hai. Ek construction tower se ek 40 m lambi uniform heavy steel cable neeche latak rahi thi. Sulekha ne neeche se cable ko ek chhota sa transverse jhatka diya aur stopwatch start kar di!\n\nUske intern ne socha: *\"Tension toh neeche zero hai aur upar jaate-jaate badh raha hai — wave ki speed constant hi nahi hai! Upar pahunchne mein kitna time lagega?\"*\n\nSulekha muskurayi: *\"Aaj hum **Gehrai Mein** utrenge — 1D Wave PDE, particle velocity vs slope, wave power aur decibel (dB) scale, hanging rope ka exact travel time **t = 2 √(L/g)**, composite strings, aur hawa (wind) + angled Doppler effect ko derive aur solve karenge!\"*",
            "bodyHinglish": "**Sulekha** ek theoretical-acoustics aur wave-propagation researcher hai. Ek construction tower se ek 40 m lambi uniform heavy steel cable neeche latak rahi thi. Sulekha ne neeche se cable ko ek chhota sa transverse jhatka diya aur stopwatch start kar di!\n\nUske intern ne socha: *\"Tension toh neeche zero hai aur upar jaate-jaate badh raha hai — wave ki speed constant hi nahi hai! Upar pahunchne mein kitna time lagega?\"*\n\nSulekha muskurayi: *\"Aaj hum **Gehrai Mein** utrenge — 1D Wave PDE, particle velocity vs slope, wave power aur decibel (dB) scale, hanging rope ka exact travel time **t = 2 √(L/g)**, composite strings, aur hawa (wind) + angled Doppler effect ko derive aur solve karenge!\"*"
